{"_id":"6a2ffb142204ffbc59e5a8d5","roadmapSlug":"python-data-analysis","nodeId":"ApowKoA3C1B8oUr4-sltZ","description":"# Dask\n\nDask is a parallel computing library for Python that scales Pandas, NumPy, and Scikit-learn to larger-than-memory datasets. It breaks data into chunks and builds a task graph that is executed lazily. Dask DataFrames mirror the Pandas API, making it easy to adapt existing code for larger datasets without switching ecosystems.","resources":[{"type":"official","title":"Dask Tutorial","url":"https://tutorial.dask.org/","_id":"6a75d326b0650226a50aebc1"},{"type":"video","title":"Intro to Dask","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=z18qjLu-Mw4&list=PLeDTMczuyDQ8S73cdc0PrnTO80kfzpgz2","_id":"6a75d326b0650226a50aebc2"}],"createdAt":"2026-06-15T13:16:04.448Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-07T12:44:22.099Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[{"_id":"6a5e3360acf8c05faf5e1c2a","title":"DataCamp - Data Analyst with Python","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/QY0dY9"},{"_id":"6a5e3365acf8c05faf5e1ded","title":"DataCamp - Python Data Fundamentals","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/k4V24x"}],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/python-data-analysis/content/ApowKoA3C1B8oUr4-sltZ.md"}